# StyleX inlines colour literals, so lightningcss will downlevel any oklch() it can
# see to lab() plus a hex fallback — which changes every computed colour value. These
# are the oldest browsers with native oklch(); raising the floor is fine, lowering it
# silently rewrites the colours.
chrome >= 111
edge >= 111
firefox >= 113
safari >= 15.4
ios_saf >= 15.4
not dead
